{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, pick it up and do specific task. If obstacle, avoid it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
